moonbeam (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed CMake configure failure on Qt6-only build roots: QT_MAJOR_VERSION
    is now set to 6 before include(KDEInstallDirs), which previously
    defaulted to the Qt5 variant and failed looking for a qmake5 executable.

 -- Agundur <info@agundur.de>  Mon, 07 Sep 2026 10:20:00 +0200

moonbeam (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Packaging-only fix: obs-submit.yml now runs `osc add` before commit
    (freshly-bootstrapped OBS package had no prior files, so `osc commit`
    silently skipped spec/_service). No functional changes over 0.1.0.

 -- Agundur <info@agundur.de>  Mon, 07 Sep 2026 10:10:00 +0200

